    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present 29 Glenomena Park to the market. An attractive semi-detached family home well set back from the road and set in spacious gardens, not overlooked and south west facing to rear. Ample parking to front and garage to side. \r\n\r\nCarefully maintained over many years, full of natural light with original features and ample room to extend subject to P.P. and create a wonderful home in this much sought-after location.\r\n\r\nA short distance from the villages of Blackrock, Stillorgan, and Donnybrook, beside bus routes, DART, sports facilities, and a wide range of schools including St. Andrews, St. Michaels, Blackrock College, Willow Park, Sion Hill, Coláiste Eoin & Íosagáin, Mount Anville, and U.C.D.\r\n\r\nComprising Reception Hall, Lounge with marble mantlepiece and French door to rear decking, dining room, kitchen with range of units. Upstairs are 4 bedrooms and showerroom with shower, W.C., WHB.\r\n\r\nOutside the gardens are spacious and secluded, south-west facing to rear with garage and side access."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Reception Hall \r\nUnderstairs storage\r\n\r\nLounge\r\nGas fire with marble mantlepiece with marble hearth, picture rail. Glazed French door and windows to decking.\r\n\r\nDining room\r\nPicture rail.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nFilled units, sink unit, extractor, plumbed for washing machine. C.H. boiler. Part tiled. Door to rear.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom (front)\r\nCorner shelved unit with vanity mirror.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (front)\r\nFitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (rear)\r\nBedroom 4 (rear)\r\n\r\nShowerroom\r\nTriton shower, W.C., WHB, vanity mirror, fully tiled.\r\n\r\nHot press on landing.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nFront garden in lawn with hedging, trees, off-street parking. South-west facing rear garden in lawn, hedging.\r\n\r\nGarage 5.2 x 2.5, side entrance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "C. 105 sq. m. / 1130 sq. ft.\r\nGFCH\r\nGarage\r\nSouth-west facing to rear\r\nSecluded gardens\r\nBeside schools, bus routes, DART, U.C.D.\r\nBeside Blackrock, Stillorgan, and Donnybrook villages."
      },
      {
